nant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-093 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='b5f2fe13992daeed01e7aa4a335d3f39c4484c31c47888248aab2444970c15de', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-093';
